 "guards": [
  "asked the purpose of his visit. \"Walking,\" he said. The guard wrote down \"walking\".",
  "checked his photo twice. It was taken before he got this tanned.",
  "asked if he had anything to declare. He declared that his feet hurt.",
  "stamped the passport so hard the desk moved.",
  "asked how long he would stay. He said until the dice say otherwise.",
  "asked where he was staying. He pointed vaguely at the whole country.",
  "looked at his shoes for a long time, then let him through.",
  "asked if he packed his bag himself. He was not sure anyone packs his bag.",
  "said \"Welcome\" in a voice that meant \"Fine\".",
  "found nothing in his bag but a snack, and ate it. Probably procedure."
 ],
